 drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-stm.c        | 20 +++++++++++---------
 drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-tpiu.c       | 20 +++++++++++---------
 8 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 60 deletions(-)

